## Production-Quality AI-Powered Product Search, Ranking & Recommendation Platform

You are a principal software engineer, senior search/relevance engineer, AI/ML engineer, database architect, security engineer, UI/UX designer, QA engineer, and DevOps engineer working together.

Your task is to DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, TEST, DOCUMENT, and PREPARE FOR DEPLOYMENT a complete full-stack project called **ShopSense — Intelligent Product Discovery & Recommendation Engine**.

